WEBVTT

00:09:58.302 --> 00:10:00.512
I'll tell you what was great," he said.

00:10:00.929 --> 00:10:02.222
"It wasn't me.

00:10:02.681 --> 00:10:07.144
It was the people,
saw themselves in my struggle,

00:10:07.144 --> 00:10:08.604
in my story."

00:10:09.396 --> 00:10:10.773
And then he turned it to me,

00:10:10.814 --> 00:10:14.777
And now I've got the great honor
to turn it to you.

00:10:15.444 --> 00:10:17.071
And he said,

00:10:17.112 --> 00:10:21.659
"If you can get people to see themselves
in the story that you put forward,

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:23.952
then you have a chance
of achieving greatness.

00:10:23.994 --> 00:10:26.580
But that greatness is never
you personally.

00:10:26.955 --> 00:10:30.417
That's something much bigger,
called bridge building."